"token-authority": "token-authority\nAlternative B uses one stable atomic Active-to-\nReleased token as native authority and marker\nvalidity; scalar count becomes nonauthoritative or\nis removed for this ownership class"
"unknown-keeper": "unknown-keeper\nStable VM guardian retains roots and session on\nunlogged legacy outcome; no timeout transfer or\nblind retry; confirmed death still needs root/roster\nhandoff"
"record-window": "record-window\nPending log alone cannot distinguish decrement-\nbefore-abandonment from abandonment-before-\ndecrement; quiescent single-credit count audit\nsupplies extra evidence only under explicit closure"
